        ],
        "english_lines": [
          "The poor bathe",
          "in tears! — while these",
          "swindlers float",
          "in rosewater! — How long",
          "will these cowards’ valour",
          "continue",
          "to fly its flag",
          "in the durbar? — A drama..."
